ncy; Hubu never uses floating point and rounds only digits beyond scale 6 up","normal settlement rejects a conservative budget charge above the authorized maximum; human vendor-billed reconciliation records an already-incurred overrun explicitly","an identical settlement retry returns the original settlement_id and receipt without consuming budget twice; a changed receipt is rejected","finalization resolves by claim_id; an executor that lost the claim response replays the identical claim, which returns the existing claim even after the authorization expires","claim expiry is evaluated once when the settlement transaction starts","release atomically marks the claim released and token revoked while returning the reserved amount","settle and release serialize so the first terminal finalization wins","expired claims keep their holds claimed for reconciliation instead of automatically releasing","claim status lookup reports reconciliation_required once a claimed lease expires","only expired claimed leases enter the reconciliation queue","the normal API bearer token cannot authorize reconciliation","a human-confirmed vendor_billed resolution settles the hold; vendor_did_not_bill releases it","each reconciliation stores the provider reference, evidence, resolving user, outcome, and timestamp"],"supported_protocol_versions":["hubu-spend-executor-v4.5","hubu-spend-executor-v4.4"],"validate_request":{"legacy_v4_4_required":["spend_auth_token_id","account_id","amount_cents"],"note":"read-only scope inspection; it never authorizes irreversible work","rejected":["operation_key","agent_id"],"required":["spend_auth_token_id","account_id","contract_version","amount.units","amount.scale","amount.currency"]},"void_unclaimed_request":{"caller":"trusted router","reason":"executor_rejected_before_claim","required":["spend_auth_token_id","account_id","operation_key"],"rules":["requires the backend bearer and the private operation key bound to this account and authorization; never exposed